## Security Considerations

### MVP Security Rules
1. **Governance-only updates** - Only governance can modify emission parameters
2. **Economic safety bounds** - Minimum validator rewards, maximum single destination
3. **Parameter validation** - Comprehensive validation of all parameter changes
4. **Emergency controls** - Governance can halt emissions in emergencies
5. **Audit trail** - Complete history of all parameter changes
6. **Gradual transitions** - Optional transition periods for major changes

### Error Handling
```go
var (
    ErrInvalidDestination          = errors.Register(ModuleName, 2, "invalid emission destination")
    ErrInvalidWeight               = errors.Register(ModuleName, 3, "invalid emission weight")
    ErrExceedsMaxDestinations      = errors.Register(ModuleName, 4, "exceeds maximum destinations")
    ErrBelowMinValidatorReward     = errors.Register(ModuleName, 5, "below minimum validator reward")
    ErrExceedsMaxSingleDestination = errors.Register(ModuleName, 6, "exceeds maximum single destination")
    ErrEmissionsStopped            = errors.Register(ModuleName, 7, "emissions are emergency stopped")
    ErrUnauthorized                = errors.Register(ModuleName, 8, "unauthorized emission parameter change")
)
```

