## Query Commands Structure
```bash
# Query current emission parameters
scarlett-cored query emissions params

# Query emission destination statistics
scarlett-cored query emissions destination-stats

# Query parameter change history
scarlett-cored query emissions history --height 1000000

# Submit governance proposal to update emissions
scarlett-cored tx gov submit-proposal /path/to/emission-proposal.json

# Vote on emission proposal
scarlett-cored tx gov vote 1 yes --from validator
```

